# SDD: Migration harness
status: active-draft
authority: migration-harness
date: 2026-09-08

## Feedforward

- Pack `AGENTS.md`, `PROMPT-GROK-MASTER.md`, `pr.md`, `prompt.md`
- This `specs/` tree (copied to `cronus-kernel/migration/specs/`)
- `LANGUAGE.md` (update only after REAL)
- `CONTRACT.md` intent → `03-ui-contract.sdd`
- Parity CSV/JSON
- `07-first-slice.sdd` and later per-component contracts

## Deterministic sensors (kernel)

Must be `cargo test` first. Then add focused tests, not a second JS toolchain.

| Sensor | First slice |
|---|---|
| Parser valid/invalid | theme/token + Button invocation |
| HTML snapshot | each Button variant/size |
| Semantic DOM | `[data-slot=button]`, disabled, type, href→a |
| Token CSS | `--cronus-primary` etc. present in light+dark |
| Forbidden color | `components.rs` button path has no `bg-amber`, `neutral-800`, `#0a0a0a` |
| Full `cargo test` | no demo parse regression (`cronus parse` when binary exists) |
| LANGUAGE.md vs code | manual in review; later a check script |

Later waves: a11y static, keyboard (browser), RTL, visual, CLI golden, compose determinism, parity completeness, no-React/no-node_modules scan on runtime artifacts.

## Error shape

`CRONUS-UI-PARITY C014: Button[variant=destructive][mode=dark] lost visible focus ring. Expected semantic ring token; selector [data-slot=button]:focus-visible has no ring rule.`

## Evidence

`migration/evidence/<wave>/<feature>/`

## Rule

Failing sensor → fix or change SDD. No silencing. No snapshot update without behavior review.
